From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Carsen <carsenk@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 04:20:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 26/26] hip: group same-activation MMVQ launches

Stock-body grouped mul_mat_vec_q: up to 4 independent decode matvecs
that share one activation, type, K, and row stride run as one grid.
A block routes itself to its segment (integer-only) then performs the
identical k-loop, y-block index, trim-slot zeros and reduction as the
individual Nemotron launch. GGML_CUDA_DISABLE_MMVQ_GROUP=1 restores
the 0025 path.

